function tryAttachStair(){if(player.stairDetachTimer>0)return;const px=player.x+player.w/2,py=player.y+player.h-6,wantsUp=input.up&&!input.down,wantsDown=input.down&&!input.up;if(!wantsUp&&!wantsDown)return;let best=null;for(const st of level.stairs){const steps=stairSteps(st);for(let i=0;i<steps.length;i++){const pose=stairPoseAtIndex(st,i),dx=Math.abs(px-pose.x),dy=Math.abs(py-pose.y),pad=Math.max(STAIR_ATTACH_PAD,pose.step.w*.72);if(dx>pad||dy>58)continue;if(wantsUp&&stairAtTop(st,i))continue;if(wantsDown&&stairAtBottom(st,i))continue;const endpointBonus=(wantsUp&&stairAtBottom(st,i))||(wantsDown&&stairAtTop(st,i))?-28:0,score=dx+dy*1.35+endpointBonus;if(!best||score<best.score)best={st,index:i,score};}}if(best)attachToStair(best.st,best.index);}
